# === Runtime state: extension registry + self-extension skill candidates ===
# data/extensions.json carries live review_token values and data/skills/.candidates/
# holds pending-review skills. Runtime state, never source.
data/extensions.json
data/skills/
# Runtime single-instance lock. It holds a live PID, so it is per-run state and
# committing it would pin a dead process id into the repository.
data/charlie.lock

